{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Work. Focus. Ignore the timer.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Then your screen gets invaded.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buzz Off! runs on top of your other applications, turning skipped breaks into pure chaos. <br>Set a timer to hydrate, stretch, or rest \u2014 and when time runs out, a relentless swarm of mosquitoes takes over your screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight back with ridiculous weapons, rack up kills, earn coins, and climb the global leaderboard \u2014 all while trying to survive your own bad habits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This isn\u2019t just a reminder.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It\u2019s consequences.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507830/extras/83a631a929c791ce33b6203e861f3b27.webp?t=1769994841\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507830/extras/83a631a929c791ce33b6203e861f3b27.poster.avif?t=1769994841\" class=\"bb_img\" width=128 height=128 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>FEATURES</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\ud83e\udd9f <strong>Desktop Invasion Gameplay</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mosquitoes appear directly over your work, study, or gaming session when your timer ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\u23f1\ufe0f <strong>Timer-Based Chaos</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set reminders for breaks \u2014 fail to take them and the swarm gets worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\ud83d\udd2b <strong>Ridiculous Weapons</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and upgrade absurd weapons to swat, slice, and blast mosquitoes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Steam Leaderboards &amp; Achievements</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete globally for the highest kill counts and unlock achievements as the chaos escalates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\ud83e\ude9f <strong>Always-On Overlay Mode</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runs alongside your other apps without stopping your workflow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you stay productive \u2014 or will the swarm win?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Set the timer. Miss the break. Buzz Off!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507830/extras/57e8e220f6f28704e0ecee55faac39f4.webp?t=1769994841\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507830/extras/57e8e220f6f28704e0ecee55faac39f4.poster.avif?t=1769994841\" class=\"bb_img\" width=256 height=256 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"100 kills","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3507830/18b2120834dd4b1d73dc6066a76e99be43519846.jpg"},{"name":"500 kills","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3507830/62109b9ffab1e75da34d6ec2f9c8e07baf076e8c.jpg"},{"name":"1k kills","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3507830/fc8c07dec4a696fea602cb73ab8406aa29567f72.jpg"},{"name":"5k kills","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3507830/6a49a6caccfa8e34784b481f98b0d530e3e07f5f.jpg"},{"name":"10k Kills","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3507830/b1e5e5c23340ac01c6c65fb825f35f47b63575ef.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":